<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Jackson, Tenn., $7.700 mln.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Jackson, Tenn., $7.700 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Securities Corp said it received the verbal award on $7.700 million of Jackson, Tenn., gas system revenue bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.638 percent in 2018.</p>
